[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 603.03, "timestamp": "00:10:03", "text": "連結直接給用戶。所以如果你喜歡V之類的東西，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 605.59, "timestamp": "00:10:05", "text": "等等，那就行不通。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 607.836, "timestamp": "00:10:07", "text": "耽誤。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 609.35, "timestamp": "00:10:09", "text": "[笑聲]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 612.949, "timestamp": "00:10:12", "text": "嗯，它有優點也有缺點，某種程度上來說是可行的，但某種程度上也會"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 616.23, "timestamp": "00:10:16", "text": "有它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 618.79, "timestamp": "00:10:18", "text": "自身的問題，不過是的，因為它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 622.31, "timestamp": "00:10:22", "text": "仍然會每 5 到 10 分鐘生成一個隨機棋盤，對吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 624.31, "timestamp": "00:10:24", "text": "或者我可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 628.949, "timestamp": "00:10:28", "text": "離線更改計時器，所以這就是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 631.43, "timestamp": "00:10:31", "text": "目前的設置，這在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 634.389, "timestamp": "00:10:34", "text": "Melt 中也能運行。所以我現在就給你展示一下"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 636.87, "timestamp": "00:10:36", "text": "。所以，如果我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 640.23, "timestamp": "00:10:40", "text": "切換到我的 BRB 場景，正如你所看到的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 643.829, "timestamp": "00:10:43", "text": "那就是嵌入內容。這是嵌入程式碼，它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 646.949, "timestamp": "00:10:46", "text": "適用於我的網站。它真的有效，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 649.59, "timestamp": "00:10:49", "text": "我很高興它有效。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 652.79, "timestamp": "00:10:52", "text": "看？是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 656.47, "timestamp": "00:10:56", "text": "這樣就能正常運作了。但通常情況下，如果我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 659.509, "timestamp": "00:10:59", "text": "輸入視訊網址，它是不會起作用的，對吧？"}]